      "sourceText": "两个节点都订阅 `loam_interface` 的 `lidar_odometry` 和 `registered_scan`；`ext` 还订阅 `terrain_map`，当前以输入里程计的位置为中心，4 m内采用近场结果、4 m外计算扩展结果，再合并输出。本块只整理 `terrain_analysis`，`terrain_analysis_ext` 的参数留到下一块。",
      "translatedText": "Both nodes subscribe to the `loam_interface` of `lidar_odometry` and `registered_scan`; `ext` also subscribes to `terrain_map` and is currently centered on the position from the input odometry, using near\\-field results within 4 m, computing extended results beyond 4 m, and then merging the outputs\\. This block only organizes `terrain_analysis`; the parameters of `terrain_analysis_ext` are left to the next block\\.",
